# Milestone 1 orchestrator (from M1-016)

Use only when the user is finishing **Milestone 1** (`DEVELOPMENT_TASKS.md`). If the active document is `DEVELOPMENT-MILESTONE2.md`, ignore this rule.

When implementing Milestone 1 remaining work:

1. Follow `.cursor/skills/m1-orchestrator/SKILL.md`.
2. Start at the first incomplete ID in **M1-016 → M1-035** (do not restart M1-001).
3. One ID per pass unless `DEVELOPMENT_TASKS.md` names a tightly coupled pair.
4. Mark `[~]` while in progress; `[x]` only after `mvn -q test` and verification without live SMTP.
5. After M1-035, write the §22 final report. Do not implement Milestone 2 **during a Milestone 1 pass**.
